    "R30-R60"
  ],
  "region": "all",
  "text": "Bedrooms have a minimum internal floor area of 9m2 and can accommodate a minimum dimension of 2.7m x 2.7m (refer Figure 2.1c). Minimum area is inclusive of built-in robes and cabinetry, however the minimum dimension excludes built-in robes and cabinetry.",
